WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
A sequence is a set of instructions in order.

00:04.000 --> 00:07.000
Move right. One arrow moves Byte one square.

00:07.000 --> 00:10.000
Move right again. Byte is now two squares across.

00:10.000 --> 00:13.000
Move up. Byte reaches the star.

00:13.000 --> 00:16.000
Right, right, up. Read your arrows in order.
